# Which upstream skills to install. One name per line; blank lines and
# lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Names are resolved against the pinned checkout by searching its buckets
# (engineering, productivity, misc, in-progress, deprecated), so a skill that
# gets promoted between buckets upstream keeps working. The bucket each one
# lived in at the time of writing is noted below for orientation only.
#
# Add a skill by adding its name here and re-running install-claude.sh.
# Run ./update-skills.sh --list to see everything available at the current pin.

